            "style": 0,
            "fore": 13290702,
            "back": 921102,
            "data1": "~Done"
        },
        {
            "type": "static",
            "id": 1020,
            "x": 8,
            "y": 265,
            "dx": 140,
            "dy": 25,
            "style": 0,
            "fore": 13290702,
            "back": -1,
            "data": "",
            "tooltip": "Sects of the Known Worlds.\n\nChanging your sect affiliation to that of the current Patriarch improves your favorability with the Church while changing your sect affiliation to another sect may decrease your favorability with the Church."
        },
        {
            "type": "static",
            "id": 1021,
            "x": 164,
            "y": 265,
            "dx": 140,
            "dy": 25,
            "style": 0,
            "fore": 13290702,
            "back": -1,
            "data": "",
            "tooltip": "Church's like of a particular House based on the Sect of their Flock.\n\nPlacing a Spy on another House's Homeworld will scry the likes for that particular House and placing a Spy on Holy Terra will scry the actual like data the Church keeps for your House (and other Houses if you also have a Spy on their Homeworld)."
        },
        {
            "type": "static",
            "id": 1022,
            "x": 307,
            "y": 265,
            "dx": 96,
            "dy": 25,
            "style": 0,
            "fore": 13290702,
            "back": -1,
            "data": "",
            "tooltip": "Flock Counts.\n\nThe Sect with the highest Flock count has the highest chance of becoming the next Patriarch after the current one dies; however, if the Patriarch's death is unexpected, the chance of a different Sect becoming the Patriarch significantly increases."
        },
        {
            "type": "static",
            "id": 1024,
            "x": 415,
            "y": 265,
            "dx": 115,
            "dy": 25,
            "style": 0,
            "fore": 13290702,
            "back": -1,
            "data": "",
            "tooltip": "Bonuses.\n\nG = Galaxy bonuses if the Patriarch is of that Sect.\nP1 - P3: Planetary bonuses if there is a Cathedral on the planet controlled by that Sect.\nI1 - I3 Individual Unit Sect bonuses if the unit is of that Sect."
        },
        {
            "type": "static",
            "id": 1023,
            "x": 164,
            "y": 437,
            "dx": 160,
            "dy": 25,
            "style": 0,
            "fore": 13290702,
            "back": -1,
            "data": "",
            "tooltip": "House(s) that have signed the Holy Writ. A House that has signed the Holy Writ will gain a bonus to their like with the Church based on the Sect of their Flock at the cost of a permanent 30% reduction in their overall score."
        }
    ]
},
